# API source of truth

- This package is the frontend SDK. It must not call `/api/v1/schema/merchants/`
  with merchant API keys. Backend SDKs implement the hub pin
  `contract/openapi/merchants.openapi.yaml`.
- Do not invent aggregator paths, headers, or error codes.
- Never put merchant API keys in frontend or plugin JavaScript.
